  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Paralyzing Gaze — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>At 3rd level, you have trained your peripheral vision to lock down multiple targets at once. When you use <em>Immobilizing Eyes</em>, you instead spend a Full-Turn Action (Action + Bonus Action + Movement) to affect a number of creatures up to your Cursed Energy modifier, spending 1 CE for every creature beyond the first. You must spend 1 CE for each targeted creature to maintain your technique against them.  </p>",
